<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ vehicle registrations fell 11 pct in July yr.</title>
<headline>NZ vehicle registrations fell 11 pct in July yr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of vehicle registrations in New Zealand fell 11 percent in July to 19,557 from 21,963 in July 1996, the Land Transport Safety Authority said on Friday.</p>
<p>Registrations were up from 16,839 in June 1997.</p>
<p>New car registrations including imports fell to 14,267 in the month from 16,259 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
